    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d358">

                <pb facs="0473" n="361" sameAs="frus:frus1910/pg361"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister of Panama to the Secretary of
                    State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Habana</hi></placeName> (<date
                            ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-document-content-and-sibling-dates"
                            calendar="gregorian" notAfter="1909-01-31T23:59:59-05:00"
                            notBefore="1909-01-30T00:00:00-05:29">undated</date>).<lb/>(Received
                        January 31, 1909.)</dateline></opener>
                <p>Secretary Arango cables me that both treaties have been ratified by Panama.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Arosemena</hi>.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
